Z||000002||WKDFIRO||11-27-1999||03:36 AM||||I do know that the Holley throttle body was larger than the 2.8 in the F-bodies but have not heard of a bigger unit from Holley. I had heard of the RS TB but never found out the size to see if it was bigger than the Holley. (I think that the stock Fiero Holley TB is 2 1/2 inches. I measured it a long time ago for something but aren't completely sure about it.) The only thing I did to my TB was to polish it and remove the coolant tubes. Really cleaned up that area nicely.<p>[This message has been edited by WKDFIRO (edited 11-27-1999).]||||reg||1
